  "verbalization": "Caesalpiniaphenol B appears to be a potential target for SNB-78 through a series of intermediate molecular interactions. The evidence suggests that Caesalpiniaphenol B directly targets MOVP-3, which in turn is a target of multiple compounds, including 5-Hydroxy-6,8-Dimethoxy-2,3-Dimethylbenzo[G]Chromen-4-One and 7-Angeloylechinatine. All three of these compounds ultimately share a common target, SNB-78. This chain of targets implies a possible pathway where Caesalpiniaphenol B may influence SNB-78 through the activation of MOVP-3, which could be a key intermediate in the biological process. The consistent scores across the three paths suggest a robust relationship, though the exact mechanism of interaction between Caesalpiniaphenol B and SNB-78 remains to be fully elucidated. The evidence supports a hierarchical relationship where Caesalpiniaphenol B acts as a starting point, leading through multiple targets to SNB-78, but the precise functional role of each intermediate remains unclear.",
